{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":27324,"name":"","username":"JackyLHH","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/jackylhh/{size}/9804_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-10T09:15:01.198Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e今年 CKCon 上，\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zz_tovarishch\"\u003e@zz_tovarishch\u003c/a\u003e 构建的 \u003ca href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/t/ckb-mbabel-live-bilingual-captions-for-zh-en-meetings/10593\"\u003eCKB mBabel\u003c/a\u003e 帮了很大的忙，也让很多人看到了实时双语字幕的价值。无论是线下会议还是线上会议，中文、英文交替发言时，有字幕在旁边，讨论会轻松很多。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e不过，自己动手部署 mBabel 并配置 API 还是有些门槛。另外，还有一些朋友希望直接用手机，尤其是线下小组讨论时，拿起来就能用。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e于是，我借助 AI 工具，做了一个云端版本：\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://mbabel.cloud/\"\u003emBabel Cloud\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e。希望把准备工作留在后台，让大家把时间用在交流上。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e网址：\u003ca href=\"https://mbabel.cloud/\"\u003ehttps://mbabel.cloud/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/a/ab6466cf190cb83d844d0e0ab8cd369c401124cf.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/ab6466cf190cb83d844d0e0ab8cd369c401124cf\" title=\"iShot_2026-11-10_16.54.04\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ab6466cf190cb83d844d0e0ab8cd369c401124cf_2_690x353.png\" alt=\"iShot_2026-11-10_16.54.04\" data-base62-sha1=\"oscKVr67JipvZQ70Qcp4OFbKZlB\" width=\"690\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ab6466cf190cb83d844d0e0ab8cd369c401124cf_2_690x353.png, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ab6466cf190cb83d844d0e0ab8cd369c401124cf_2_1035x529.png 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ab6466cf190cb83d844d0e0ab8cd369c401124cf_2_1380x706.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"151B1B\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eiShot_2026-11-10_16.54.04\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2928×1500 317 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27324-mbabel-cloud-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27324-mbabel-cloud-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003emBabel Cloud 能做什么？\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e它是一个实时中英字幕与会议文字记录工具，无需自行部署或配置 API：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e实时双语字幕\u003c/strong\u003e：原文在上、译文在下，支持快译、说话人区分和时间码。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e热词与翻译术语\u003c/strong\u003e：内置了 500 多个热词和 380 多条翻译术语，让 Nervos 生态的专有名称得到更准确的识别和翻译。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e分享字幕\u003c/strong\u003e：把链接或二维码发给其他人，大家可以用自己的设备看字幕、调整字号。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e保存与导出\u003c/strong\u003e：会议文字可选择保存 3、7、30 天，或不保存；支持导出 Markdown、TXT，网站不保存音频。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e电脑端适合在线会议，\u003cstrong\u003e建议使用 Chrome 浏览器\u003c/strong\u003e；手机端适合面对面交流、小组讨论，也可以作为字幕阅读屏（手机浏览器目前无法直接采集 Meet、Zoom 等会议 App 的内部声音，所以不适合在线会议）。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27324-ckb-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27324-ckb-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e用钱包登录，用 CKB 购买时长\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003emBabel Cloud 集成了 \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/ckb-devrel/ccc\"\u003eCCC\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e，支持 JoyID、MetaMask 等钱包登录，无需另外注册账号。当然，网站也保留了用户名登录，方便不同使用习惯的朋友。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e目前套餐只接受 \u003cstrong\u003eCKB 支付\u003c/strong\u003e（也可以使用兑换码兑换翻译时长）。购买时既可以连接钱包支付，也可以用手机钱包扫码付款。这算是给大家手里的 CKB 又找了一个消费场景（\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/images/emoji/apple/grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes.png?v=15\" title=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/images/emoji/apple/grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes.png?v=15\" title=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/images/emoji/apple/grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes.png?v=15\" title=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e ）。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e目前 mBabel Cloud 采用预付费，使用时按秒结算。未来，等 Fiber 相关基础设施更成熟，尤其是 CCC 支持 Fiber 后，我计划进一步实现按秒付费的流支付功能，让付款也随着对话自然发生。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27324-h-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27324-h-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e欢迎试用，也欢迎反馈\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e产品还在持续打磨，真实使用中的反馈对我很有帮助。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e欢迎大家通过 Discord、\u003ca href=\"https://t.me/JackyLHH\"\u003eTelegram\u003c/a\u003e 或 Nervos Talk 私信联系我，\u003cstrong\u003e免费领取 2 个兑换码，每个可兑换 1 小时翻译时长\u003c/strong\u003e。兑换码可以自己用，也可以分一个给朋友，一起试用。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e哪里不顺手，需要增加什么功能，或者你觉得某个功能根本没必要，都可以直接告诉我。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e最后，特别感谢 \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zz_tovarishch\"\u003e@zz_tovarishch\u003c/a\u003e 做出并开源了 CKB mBabel，让这个云端版本有了起点。还要感谢 Julie、JXL、 \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zz_tovarishch\"\u003e@zz_tovarishch\u003c/a\u003e  等第一批用户，花时间试用、反馈，让 \u003ca href=\"https://mbabel.cloud/\"\u003emBabel Cloud\u003c/a\u003e 这个工具更好用。\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:15:01.198Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":26,"readers_count":25,"score":200.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":11162,"topic_slug":"mbabel-cloud","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://mbabel.cloud/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"mBabel Cloud · 听懂彼此","clicks":4},{"url":"https://talk.nervos.org/t/ckb-mbabel-live-bilingual-captions-for-zh-en-meetings/10593","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"CKB mBabel: Live Bilingual Captions for zh↔en Meetings","clicks":0},{"url":"https://github.com/ckb-devrel/ccc","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"https://t.me/JackyLHH","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Telegram: Contact @JackyLHH","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"谢谢","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":8}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":600,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/mbabel-cloud/11162/1","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":8}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":8,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false,"can_translate":false},{"id":27583,"name":"","username":"JackyLHH","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/jackylhh/{size}/9804_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T11:46:34.406Z","cooked":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27583-updates-log-nov-19-2026-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27583-updates-log-nov-19-2026-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUpdates Log · Nov 19, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdded caption support for \u003cstrong\u003eChinese ↔ Vietnamese\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eEnglish ↔ Vietnamese\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade \u003cstrong\u003eFast\u003c/strong\u003e (Low Latency) the default segmentation mode for all users.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated the shared vocabulary for all users, including \u003cstrong\u003ehotwords, correction rules, and translation terms\u003c/strong\u003e. Hotwords apply to Chinese–English meetings, while corrections and translation terms cover all three language pairs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSwitched to CCC’s native wallet picker, enabled camera access for Khie QR scanning, and moved sign-out to the profile menu.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImproved visibility of success, error, and warning prompts across the site.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecial thanks to \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hanssen\"\u003e@Hanssen\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zz_tovarishch\"\u003e@zz_tovarishch\u003c/a\u003e for their valuable feedback.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere are \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1lpgorqfkeiAOadJLRRYfEiOZs6j48yHEFYWSdBzaQ1M/edit?usp=sharing\"\u003e50 new redeem codes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e. Pls feel free to claim them, keep testing/using \u003ca href=\"https://mbabel.cloud/\"\u003emBabel Cloud\u003c/a\u003e, and share any suggestions for further improvements. Thanks \u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/images/emoji/apple/heart.png?v=15\" title=\":heart:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":heart:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:46:34.406Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":152.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":11162,"topic_slug":"mbabel-cloud","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1lpgorqfkeiAOadJLRRYfEiOZs6j48yHEFYWSdBzaQ1M/edit?usp=sharing","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"mBabel Cloud Redeem Codes - Google Sheets","clicks":1},{"url":"https://mbabel.cloud/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"mBabel Cloud · 听懂彼此","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"谢谢","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":4}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":600,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/mbabel-cloud/11162/2","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":4}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":4,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false}],"stream":[27324,27583]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,10],[2,1]]